<div id="center-container">

    <main>
        <div id="welcome-title">
            <h1>Welcome to The Whimsy Corner!</h1>
        </div>

        <div id="welcome-image">

            <img src="https://files.catbox.moe/oszszn.png">

        </div>

        <div id="welcome-text">
            <p>

                <img src="https://files.catbox.moe/my1cdk.png">
                <br>
                <br>
                Hello! Welcome to my little space on the internet were I share
                my art and other special interests I am interested in! I've gotten
                tired of the social media I've been using. Most of them are allowing AI to run rampant.
                I then thought I should make a space for myself were I can post my art. And then
                I learned that the indie web was a thing. I realized I can use this website to post my art
                and share my other special interests. This was a good reason to finally learn
                web development <img src="https://e.deviantart.net/emoticons/m/meow.gif">.

            </p>

            <p>
                I love to bring a chill, and cosy vibe, fun, acceptance, and open-mindedness the space I 
                am in. If you like the energy, stick around! But please be mindful of the energy you bring 
                into this space!
            </p>

            <p>
                I'm still learning so if something looks off or is broken I apologize.
                Feel free to offer any tips on how I could make the site better! I was thinking of
                ways to make the site more accesisble. I'm not sure if the fonts I used are readable. 
                If you have a hard time reading them let me know!
            </p>

            <p> 
                Also I do have gifs visible on the page. I know that will be an issue for some disabled viwers
                so I added buttons to turn off the gifs. There will be some pages where the buttons doesn't work
                like the blog and gallery pages so be careful on those pages!
            </p>

        </div>
    </main>

